            {
             "type": "element",
             "id": "el-argument",
             "kind": "text",
             "paragraphs": [
              {
               "role": "type.body",
               "text": "Gross margin has risen in four of the last five years, and every rise came from mix rather than from price."
              },
              {
               "role": "type.body",
               "text": "Aftermarket grew faster than original equipment in each of those years, and it carries roughly twice the gross margin."
              },
              {
               "role": "type.body",
               "text": "EBITDA margin has followed with a lag, because the selling cost of winning the installed base is paid before the aftermarket arrives."
              },
              {
               "role": "type.body",
               "text": "The forecast assumes the mix shift continues at the rate already observed and assumes no price recovery at all."
              }
             ]
            },
